{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん元気してますか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここ最近は握手会がないけど、テレビの前では会えてるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうすぐ7thの特典イベントや、zipフェスなどあるから、来られる方は是非とも来てくださいね( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2014/03/15/9429798/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影：さゆりん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レッスン終わりにストレッチしてたら、可愛い若い子ちゃん達に足を抑えつけられました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手前がまあやで奥がひなちま♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後ろの方にはろってぃー(^｡^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これはいじめやいじめ(T ^ T)\n私の足をどうしたいというのだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、こうして遊んでくる妹のような二人が大好きよ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう言えばね、NOGIBINGO!見て思ったんだけど、自分のリアクションが酷すぎて引きました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな可愛いのに、私だけ本気すぎて見てられない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リアクションに可愛らしさが欲しい今日この頃です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本気で、本気で恥ずかしい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな私だけど、大丈夫ですか？(T ^ T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のアナザースカイ、川口春奈ちゃん可愛いのに面白くて好きになった！(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2014/03/15/9429